{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/92a98686cf3d434874d80d50f195fa13.avif?t=1772553989\" width=1560 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/0fdf7c177744d760c0a582bbb9a4f73f.poster.avif?t=1772553989\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/0fdf7c177744d760c0a582bbb9a4f73f.webm?t=1772553989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/0fdf7c177744d760c0a582bbb9a4f73f.mp4?t=1772553989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The speed limit is infinity.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed multiplies your damage. Grapple, slide, wall-run, and rail-grind to build momentum.  Dodge bullet-hell barrages with wild movement tech and perfectly timed parries.\u00a0Rip through robots in style to rack up views as your rampage goes viral worldwide in a fully-voiced story campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/3186d34ffdbd75d672468807b88b478f.avif?t=1772553989\" width=1560 height=133 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/921112c9fb161a0a7cc26f8bcf39baf1.poster.avif?t=1772553989\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/921112c9fb161a0a7cc26f8bcf39baf1.webm?t=1772553989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/921112c9fb161a0a7cc26f8bcf39baf1.mp4?t=1772553989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If it sounds broken, it probably is.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn shotguns into flamethrowers. Turn bananas into nukes. Dual-wield absurd weapon combos and stack every upgrade to break the game and completely change how you fight. Show no mercy on rogue robots and evil billionaires.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/a96f88aacaf947e79323b743384fbac5.avif?t=1772553989\" width=1560 height=133 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/f87317e807237baa5d887adcefa804c7.poster.avif?t=1772553989\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/f87317e807237baa5d887adcefa804c7.webm?t=1772553989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/f87317e807237baa5d887adcefa804c7.mp4?t=1772553989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle legends like Johnny Jetpack.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash with quirky villains that stand in your way. Rack up kills to bend time and shatter clusters of foes in a single moment. Each run is a new flavor of chaos. Every death makes you stronger. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/f50d6edf5f1d5815265ef1636de42c58.avif?t=1772553989\" width=1560 height=133 /></span></h2><